# Witness: an approval whose reviewer-alias line was deleted rather than filled

The four field names are a fixed enumeration, and every other H4 witness fills this one - so
without this input the enumeration could shrink by a quarter with the suite green. An alias is
what makes an attributable commit attributable to a person.

